              "name": "Donnaskitchen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had snow peas on hand that I didn't know what to do with - Now I do! This is an excellent recipe and so quick! My husband loved it! Water chestnuts just makes this dish and the sauce was fabulous. Thanks for sharing a great recipe!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
